<Project Sdk="Microsoft.NET.Sdk">
  <PropertyGroup>
    <TargetFramework>net10.0</TargetFramework>
    <ImplicitUsings>enable</ImplicitUsings>
    <Nullable>enable</Nullable>
    <Description>ACadSharp-backed DXF/DWG document sessions and the foundation for retained GPU-accelerated 2D/3D CAD rendering, editing, printing, and save workflows.</Description>
    <PackageDescription>ACadSharp-backed DXF/DWG document sessions and the foundation for retained GPU-accelerated 2D/3D CAD rendering, editing, printing, and save workflows.</PackageDescription>
    <PackageReleaseNotes>Introduces the ProGPU.CAD foundation and first immutable-scene/physical-output slice: pinned ACadSharp object model, typed DXF/DWG stream IO plus same-directory staged path replacement, bounded clean-room external LIN library parsing plus atomic load/reload, generation-tagged WCS snapshots, bounded reversible transform/entity-property/layer-property/layer-table-lifecycle-and-populated-merge/entity-add-remove-duplicate/reference-owned/constant-definition/variable-definition-default/definition-prompt/definition-tag/definition-mode/definition-constant-ownership attribute editing plus selected-block attribute property synchronization and drawing-persisted ATTMODE Normal/On/Off, persisted draw-order, named-page-setup creation/update/rename/deletion/import and named-page-setup-to-layout edits plus complete bounded reversible field patches for layout or named printer/media/paper/margin/origin/unit/rotation/area/window/view/scale/flag/style/shade state, caller-buffered selection candidates with semantic root-handle deduplication, typed exact point and world-space Window/Crossing tests, an integrated exact-bounds query, shared plan-viewport mapping, desktop/browser click/drag selection overlays, finite-step multi-selection Move plus complete-selection-centered WCS-Z Rotate and uniform Scale, shared mixed/common multi-selection Color, standard Lineweight, Layer, loaded Linetype, positive Linetype Scale, and Transparency editing with Undo/Redo, camera-preserving rebase compensation, transactional retained-picture replacement, bounded detached layout/named-page-setup extraction with explicit fidelity diagnostics, a retained model-space print plan, and atomic paper-layout snapshots with rectangular and exact closed-2D-polyline/circle/ellipse/degree-1-through-3 rational-SPLINE orthographic WCS-top VIEWPORT DCS pan/target/twist/scale, hidden boundary dependency retention, frozen-layer scene sharing, clipped managed/native replay including exact native affine late-camera flattening, independent viewport-border visibility, persisted DXF/DWG boundary references, persisted paper/model ordering, and physical inch/millimeter 1:1 Layout printing that ignores stored scale selection and accepts the exact paper-only ScaleLineweights no-op; physical output covers paper/margins, all four page rotations, rotated-origin offsets, plottable-layer filtering, layout-owned WCS DrawingLimits, Fit/custom and all 32 canonical standard model scales, center/offset placement, output-DPI lineweights, hierarchical spatial queries, large-coordinate rebasing, retained analytic geometry, bounded static block arrays with variable/constant/hidden single-line or embedded-multiline attributes, shaped TrueType TEXT/MTEXT, bounded standard, direct-Unicode, packed-multibyte, typed UNIFONT shape-file, and indexed regular/extended Big Font horizontal SHX TEXT/MTEXT and standalone-SHAPE parsing/layout/caching/catalog/FMP resolution with strict persisted-code-page mapping and complex-linetype reuse, standalone DXF/DWG SHAPE identity/OCS/block-transform lowering through one cached retained path with exact selection and round-trip coverage, bounded analytic Normal solid HATCH polyline/line/circular-arc/elliptic-arc loops with odd-parity fill, exact signed-thickness SOLID/3DFACE surfaces, modern level-zero or bounded crease-aware subdivided plus legacy MESH surfaces with semantic selection, managed depth replay, optional native replay, printing, and round-trip coverage, bounded BODY/REGION/3DSOLID payload and display-wire snapshots with managed/native batched replay, exact selection, and payload-safe transform rejection, and bounded IMAGE/IMAGEDEF snapshots with typed lazy per-device raster leases, effects, clipping, exact selection, managed/native replay, print reuse, editing, and DXF/DWG fidelity.</PackageReleaseNotes>
    <PackageReleaseNotes>$(PackageReleaseNotes) Adds explicit fail-closed/output-device-hairline lowering when a page setup disables assigned object and layer lineweights, explicit fail-closed/preserve-retained-alpha lowering when its Plot Transparency state is unavailable, bounded retained multi-page jobs with forward/reverse collated or uncollated copies, bounded selection-set linear COPY arrays with item-count-includes-source Step/Fit placement, one-generation Undo/Redo, shared desktop/browser controls, bounded invariant absolute/relative Cartesian/polar point and displacement input for MOVE/COPY, and DXF/DWG persistence, plus bounded white-paper CPU-raster PDF and PNG stream output with explicit DPI, physical media, staged destination commit, and shared picker/download controls.</PackageReleaseNotes>
    <PackageReleaseNotes>$(PackageReleaseNotes) Adds caller-buffered generation-tagged Intersection/Endpoint/Midpoint/Center/Quadrant/Node object snapping over exact retained finite/unbounded line, circle, arc, ellipse, 2D/3D polyline, open rational-spline, and POINT geometry, including retained-axis and authored-sweep Quadrants plus bounded exact same-WCS-plane analytic pair solving with explicit second-source identity and entity/component work truncation, deterministic device-space arbitration, zero-allocation warm queries, fixed-device shared desktop/browser markers, and exact double-WCS MOVE/COPY point commits.</PackageReleaseNotes>
    <PackageReleaseNotes>$(PackageReleaseNotes) Adds exact active-VPORT rectangular grid acquisition, persisted ORTHOMODE second-point constraints, and current-UCS/ANGBASE/ANGDIR incremental polar tracking with allocation-free O(1) queries, deterministic precedence and mutual exclusion, exact double-WCS commits, and shared desktop/browser controls and transient guides.</PackageReleaseNotes>
    <PackageReleaseNotes>$(PackageReleaseNotes) Adds bounded invariant positive direct-distance entry for shared MOVE/COPY second-point prompts, with allocation-free overflow-safe resolution along raw, exact Ortho, or acquired polar cursor directions, base-plane preservation, constraint-aware action enablement, and one exact double-WCS commit.</PackageReleaseNotes>
    <PackageReleaseNotes>$(PackageReleaseNotes) Adds active-VPORT rectangular drafting-grid display with independent GRIDUNIT spacing, GRIDDISPLAY adaptive/subdivision/limits behavior, rotated UCS/SNAPBASE/SNAPANG alignment, fixed-device quarter-pixel dots, and one affine managed/native GPU quad independent of visible lattice count.</PackageReleaseNotes>
    <PackageReleaseNotes>$(PackageReleaseNotes) Adds typed reversible active-VPORT GRIDMODE, rectangular GRIDUNIT, GRIDDISPLAY adaptive/subdivision/limits, and GRIDMAJOR editing through shared desktop/browser controls, including exact SNAP-state isolation, zero-spacing inheritance, raw-flag preservation, and DXF/DWG round trips.</PackageReleaseNotes>
    <PackageReleaseNotes>$(PackageReleaseNotes) Adds the host-level model-space GRIDSTYLE Lines/Dots choice with AutoCAD-compatible lined default plus fixed-device one-pixel minor and two-pixel GRIDMAJOR lines through the same one-quad canonical managed/native shader path, without writing registry state into DXF/DWG.</PackageReleaseNotes>
    <PackageReleaseNotes>$(PackageReleaseNotes) Adds exact active-VPORT Left/Top/Right isometric SNAPSTYL/SNAPISOPAIR support with equal-aspect Euclidean-nearest triangular-lattice acquisition, active-pair Ortho, affine one-quad dot display, typed generation-safe SNAPUNIT/style/plane editing through shared desktop/browser controls, and ACadSharp.ProGPU DXF/DWG VPORT persistence.</PackageReleaseNotes>
    <PackageReleaseNotes>$(PackageReleaseNotes) Adds shared desktop/browser F5 and Ctrl+E drawing-persisted SNAPISOPAIR cycling in Left/Top/Right order through one exact generation-safe reversible edit, including dormant rectangular-style retention and staged-grid-edit protection.</PackageReleaseNotes>
    <PackageReleaseNotes>$(PackageReleaseNotes) Adds shared desktop/browser F8 drawing-persisted ORTHOMODE editing and profile-scoped F10 Polar Tracking with exact mutual exclusion, one-generation ORTHOMODE Undo/Redo, active-prompt refresh, staged-grid-edit protection, and ACadSharp.ProGPU DXF/DWG persistence.</PackageReleaseNotes>
    <PackageReleaseNotes>$(PackageReleaseNotes) Adds shared desktop/browser F9 drawing-persisted active-VPORT SNAPMODE, profile-scoped Grid/Polar SNAPTYPE and POLARDIST, allocation-free acquired-path PolarSnap with zero-distance Snap-X inheritance, exact object-snap/direct-distance precedence, staged-edit protection, Undo/Redo synchronization, and DXF/DWG persistence.</PackageReleaseNotes>
    <PackageReleaseNotes>$(PackageReleaseNotes) Adds shared desktop/browser POLARADDANG profile controls with a bounded ten-angle invariant semicolon contract, inline immutable storage, allocation-free absolute non-incremental path arbitration, live prompt refresh, invalid-list fail-closed behavior, and exact object-snap, PolarSnap, ANGDIR, and direct-distance composition.</PackageReleaseNotes>
    <PackageReleaseNotes>$(PackageReleaseNotes) Adds bounded shared desktop/browser LINE authoring with separate contiguous entities, retained transient segment preview, segment-local Undo and Close, Enter/Escape completion, current-property capture, one-generation sequence Undo/Redo, DXF/DWG round trips, shared point constraints, and actual-last-segment relative polar plus exact direct-distance composition.</PackageReleaseNotes>
    <PackageReleaseNotes>$(PackageReleaseNotes) Adds bounded shared desktop/browser RAY authoring with one fixed WCS start, repeated through points, overflow-resistant unit directions, exact viewport-clipped retained multi-ray preview, ray-local Undo, Enter/Escape completion, current-property capture, one-generation identity-preserving sequence Undo/Redo, shared point constraints and direct distance, DXF/DWG round trips, and managed/native replay.</PackageReleaseNotes>
    <PackageReleaseNotes>$(PackageReleaseNotes) Adds bounded shared desktop/browser POINT authoring with one immediate exact WCS commit, active-UCS group-210/group-50 marker orientation, object-snap/grid pointer acquisition, absolute invariant typed input, Escape cancellation, current-property capture with nonzero-THICKNESS fail-closed preflight, identity-preserving Undo/Redo, DXF/DWG round trips, and existing exact PDMODE/PDSIZE managed/native replay.</PackageReleaseNotes>
    <PackageReleaseNotes>$(PackageReleaseNotes) Adds bounded default two-point XLINE authoring with one fixed WCS point, repeated through points, overflow-resistant unit directions, exact two-sided viewport-clipped retained preview, line-local Undo, Enter/Escape completion, current-property capture, one-generation identity-preserving sequence Undo/Redo, shared point constraints and direct distance, DXF/DWG round trips, and managed/native replay.</PackageReleaseNotes>
    <PackageReleaseNotes>$(PackageReleaseNotes) Adds immutable heterogeneous XLINE point/direction edits and allocation-free exact construction solvers for current-basis Horizontal/Vertical and Angle, reference-relative Angle, internal three-point Bisect, positive distance plus side Offset, and coplanar Through Offset, with transactional validation and identity-preserving history.</PackageReleaseNotes>
    <PackageReleaseNotes>$(PackageReleaseNotes) Adds bounded host-neutral XLINE mode prompts, raw active-UCS plus ANGBASE/ANGDIR snapshot context, and allocation-free generation-exact LINE/RAY/XLINE source resolution for reference Angle and distance/Through Offset, with recoverable invalid input and bounded local Undo.</PackageReleaseNotes>
    <PackageReleaseNotes>$(PackageReleaseNotes) Adds viewport-independent authored-origin A-aligned simple and complex linetype phase for RAY/XLINE, direct-seek signed-interval lowering, transactional document budgets and continuous fallback diagnostics, source-order retained batching, shared TrueType/SHX placements, print statistics, and managed/native replay.</PackageReleaseNotes>
    <PackageReleaseNotes>$(PackageReleaseNotes) Adds bounded shared desktop/browser PLINE authoring as one planar LWPOLYLINE with straight and exact signed-bulge tangent-arc segments, line/arc modes, segment-local Undo, line or tangent-arc Close, retained analytic accepted preview, allocation-free DPI-aware bounded live preview, actual endpoint-tangent relative polar and direct distance, current-property, PLINEGEN, and fill-on constant-PLINEWID capture, one-generation Undo/Redo, and DXF/DWG round trips.</PackageReleaseNotes>
    <PackageReleaseNotes>$(PackageReleaseNotes) Extends shared PLINE authoring with AutoCAD-compatible Width and Halfwidth start/end prompts, end-width propagation and reversible PLINEWID persistence, explicit tapered straight-segment widths with PLINEGEN suppression, line-mode Length along the actual prior line-or-arc endpoint tangent, recoverable scalar validation, exact variable-arc fail-closed behavior, DXF/DWG width/default-width round trips, and a maximum-bound p50/p95/p99 benchmark lane.</PackageReleaseNotes>
    <PackageReleaseNotes>$(PackageReleaseNotes) Extends shared PLINE Arc mode with exact signed-bulge Angle, fixed-radius projected Center, start-tangent Direction, positive-radius minor, and oriented Second-point constructions from the original ProGPU ARC solver provenance, including recoverable typed prompts, a shared option selector, analytic live preview, ARC differential tests, and maximum-bound p50/p95/p99 evidence.</PackageReleaseNotes>
    <PackageReleaseNotes>$(PackageReleaseNotes) Completes contextual PLINE Arc nesting for Angle/Center, Angle/Radius/chord-direction, Center/Angle, and Center/signed-chord-Length with exact minor/major and clockwise semantics, resolved-endpoint viewport and live-preview integration, recoverable prompts, contextual shared controls, ARC differential and large-WCS regressions, and a maximum-bound nested-solver p50/p95/p99 lane.</PackageReleaseNotes>
    <PackageReleaseNotes>$(PackageReleaseNotes) Adds independent signed minor/major Radius selection and transient Ctrl clockwise point-final PLINE Arc solutions for Center, Direction, and Radius, with live preview refresh, typed/pointer parity, ARC differential coverage, and maximum-bound p50/p95/p99 evidence.</PackageReleaseNotes>
    <PackageReleaseNotes>$(PackageReleaseNotes) Adds bounded shared desktop/browser plan-view CIRCLE authoring by center/radius, center/diameter, two diameter endpoints, or three circumference points, with direct numeric radius/diameter values, normalized large-WCS circumcircle solving, exact shared point constraints, O(1) analytic preview, Escape cancellation, current-property capture, nonzero-THICKNESS fail-closed preflight, recoverable final-point failure, one-generation Undo/Redo, and DXF/DWG round trips.</PackageReleaseNotes>
    <PackageReleaseNotes>$(PackageReleaseNotes) Adds bounded shared desktop/browser plan-view ARC authoring for all ten independent 3P, Center/Start, Start/Center, and Start/End endpoint/angle/chord/direction/radius constructions, with normalized large-WCS solves, exact signed clockwise/minor/major and ANGDIR semantics, shared point constraints and direct distance, one analytic ArcSegment preview, Escape cancellation, current-property capture, nonzero-THICKNESS fail-closed preflight, recoverable final-input failure, one-generation Undo/Redo, and DXF/DWG round trips.</PackageReleaseNotes>
    <PackageReleaseNotes>$(PackageReleaseNotes) Adds transient Ctrl clockwise ARC point-final routes for Center/Start/End, Start/Center/End, and Start/End/Direction with same-circle canonicalization, live preview refresh, typed/pointer parity, default compatibility, and a checked-in 65,536-solve p50/p95/p99 lane.</PackageReleaseNotes>
    <PackageReleaseNotes>$(PackageReleaseNotes) Adds bounded shared desktop/browser plan-view ELLIPSE authoring for full ellipses and elliptical arcs across axis-endpoint or Center, other-axis distance or Rotation, and Angle/Parameter/Included-Angle constructions, with overflow-resistant large-WCS solves, canonical analytic axes and DXF parameter intervals, exact ANGBASE/ANGDIR direction semantics, shared point constraints and direct distance, one transformed analytic ellipse or ArcSegment preview, Escape cancellation, current-property capture, nonzero-THICKNESS fail-closed preflight, recoverable final-input failure, one-generation Undo/Redo, DXF/DWG round trips, and managed/native replay.</PackageReleaseNotes>
    <PackageReleaseNotes>$(PackageReleaseNotes) Adds bounded shared desktop/browser regular POLYGON authoring with exact 3-through-1024 side validation and Inscribed, Circumscribed, or Edge construction, current-SNAPANG numeric-radius bottom-edge alignment, shared point constraints and direct distance, one retained canonical unit-polygon transformed preview, Escape cancellation, current-property, PLINEGEN, and fill-on constant-PLINEWID capture, recoverable final-input failure, one closed zero-bulge LWPOLYLINE, one-generation Undo/Redo, DXF/DWG round trips, and managed/native replay.</PackageReleaseNotes>
    <PackageReleaseNotes>$(PackageReleaseNotes) Adds bounded shared desktop/browser plan-view RECTANG authoring by diagonal corners, Dimensions, or corner-corrected Area, with ANGBASE/ANGDIR Rotation, mutually exclusive Chamfer/Fillet settings, exact signed quarter-circle bulges, maximum-radius stadium/circle coalescing, zero-allocation caller-buffered preview solving, shared point constraints and direct distance, analytic line/arc preview, Escape cancellation, profile-retained settings, current-property, PLINEGEN, and fill-on constant-PLINEWID capture, recoverable final-input failure, one closed LWPOLYLINE, one-generation Undo/Redo, DXF/DWG round trips, and managed/native replay.</PackageReleaseNotes>
    <PackageReleaseNotes>$(PackageReleaseNotes) Adds exact fill-on constant-width LWPOLYLINE snapshot bounds and one retained source-space bevel/butt analytic stroke shared by managed, native, affine block, camera, and print paths; variable widths, FILLMODE-off outlines, patterned-wide caps, and exact point/crossing selection remain explicit.</PackageReleaseNotes>
    <PackageReleaseNotes>$(PackageReleaseNotes) Extends that exact retained stroke to legacy POLYLINE entity defaults and constant per-segment overrides, with documented open/closed precedence, analytic bulges, affine OCS bounds, exact point and Window/Crossing selection, managed/native/print replay, DXF/DWG persistence, and typed rejection of tapered, FILLMODE-off, or extruded cases.</PackageReleaseNotes>
    <PackageReleaseNotes>$(PackageReleaseNotes) Adds exact fill-on variable-width straight LWPOLYLINE and legacy POLYLINE lowering as one nonzero filled path of tapered trapezoids and discontinuous bevels, with affine bounds, zero-allocation exact selection, one-command managed/native/print parity, explicit DXF width-presence fidelity including taper-to-zero, matched Release/Allocations/Time Profiler evidence, constant-profile fast-path collapse, and typed rejection of spiral-boundary bulges, mixed skinny segments, FILLMODE-off outlines, or extrusion.</PackageReleaseNotes>
    <PackageReleaseNotes>$(PackageReleaseNotes) Adds drawing-persisted FILLMODE-off wide-polyline rendering and authoring as one seam-preserving retained outline: exact straight/tapered cells, straight bevel cells, and constant-width concentric annular bulge sectors use resolved entity lineweight across managed/native/print replay, with O(S) topology, zero-allocation stable replay, matched Release/Time Profiler evidence, and typed rejection when a signed inner bulge boundary crosses its center.</PackageReleaseNotes>
    <PackageTags>progpu;cad;dxf;dwg;acadsharp;webgpu;rendering;editing</PackageTags>
  </PropertyGroup>

